# Cursor shorthand

- **`crs`** — check, report, suggest; every bullet starts with ✅ 🟢 ⚠️ ❌ or 💡. Modifiers: `crs 🟢−` `crs 📋` `crs 💡` `crs 🔍`. See `crs.mdc`.
- **`rt pl`** — implementation plan (planning mode); length OK.
- **`iml`** — implement last plan; code/diffs OK.
